### Third-Party Content

The application references and normalises data from the [LearnOnDemandSystems/labauthor](https://github.com/LearnOnDemandSystems/labauthor) repository. That repository does not include a LICENSE file at the time of synchronisation. Attribution is preserved throughout the application, and original repository paths and GitHub URLs are maintained in the evidence data.

If you intend to redistribute this application or its data, you should:

1. Review the terms of the LearnOnDemandSystems/labauthor repository
2. Preserve all attribution notices
3. Consult with legal counsel regarding licensing requirements

